WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
Light Fuhajin intentionally whiffs while Ryu is down.

2
00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:01.700
Juri retreats from Ryu’s wake-up throw.

3
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.500
Crouching medium punch punishes the missed throw.

4
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.500
Standing heavy punch links into the heavy-Fuhajin continuation.

5
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.500
Heavy Tensenrin completes the punish.
